<title>HUNGARY: TABLE-HUNGARY JULY DETAILED CPI DATA.</title>
<headline>TABLE-HUNGARY JULY DETAILED CPI DATA.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's consumer prices fell</p>
<p>0.1 percent in July month-on-month, taking the year-on-year</p>
<p>figure to 18.1 percent, the Central Statistical Office (KSH)</p>
<p>said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>DETAILED DATA FOR JULY 1997</p>
<p>				mth/mth   yr/yr	   index (pct)</p>
<p> Food products	     -1.7     18.7	     28.6</p>
<p>Alcoholic</p>
<p>beverages and</p>
<p> tobacco products	   0.7     18.2		9.0</p>
<p> Clothing		     0.3     18.2		6.3</p>
<p> Durable consumer goods   0.8	8.7		6.2</p>
<p> Household energy	   0.8     26.9		8.0</p>
<p> Other goods, fuels	-0.4     14.3	     17.0</p>
<p> Services		     1.0     19.0	     24.9</p>
<p> Total			 -0.1     18.1	    100.0</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
